<title>USA: AccuStaff - Career Horizons deal is cleared.</title>
<headline>AccuStaff - Career Horizons deal is cleared.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>AccuStaff Inc said Wednesday it had received early termination of the antitrust waiting period for its proposed acquisition of Career Horizons Inc.</p>
<p>The two companies also said they sent proxy materials to stockholders on October 8 in advance of special meetings to be held November 14.</p>
<p>AccuStaff and Career Horizons signed a definitive agreement to merge in August. The deal is valued at about $1 billion.</p>
</text>
